const pcnPackStepTitles=[['intake','Tiếp nhận proposal'],['select','Tìm workflow PUBLISHED'],['dossier','Tạo đúng 1 dossier'],['snapshot','Chụp workflowSnapshot'],['assign','Phân công / claim'],['native','Thực thi node theo snapshot'],['docs','Checklist / file'],['review','Technical review / approval'],['release','Issue / deliver / archive']];
const pcnPackStepFiles=PCN_PACK_STEP_FILES;
const pgdStepFiles=pgdProfileStepFiles;
const PCN_ITEM_STATE='Checklist MISSING / PRESENT / WAIVED; PRESENT requires an attached currentVersionId. Generated draft is not complete until confirm-to-dossier; upload must be attached; review/verification are separate gates; older versions are superseded.';
const PGD_ITEM_STATE='Checklist MISSING / PRESENT / WAIVED; MISSING when no linked current file asset exists. An unattached upload does not satisfy the gate. No separate per-file DRAFT / GENERATED / CONFIRMED status is defined in the PGD checklist model; package still checks completeness/private asset/hash. WAIVED is shown only when a record exists; mutation path not verified.';
const PGD_TEMPLATE_KIND={'INTAKE_REQUEST':'REQUEST_PYC','ASSIGNMENT':'ASSIGNMENT_FORM','INSPECTION_PLAN':'INSPECTION_PLAN','FIELD_INSPECTION':'FIELD_INSPECTION_MINUTES','SAMPLE_TAKING':'FIELD_SAMPLE_TAKING','LAB_REQUEST':'SAMPLE_HANDOVER_LAB','INSPECTION_REPORT':'INSPECTION_REPORT','DECISION':'DECISION','INSPECTION_CERTIFICATE':'INSPECTION_CERTIFICATE','DOSSIER_COVER':'DOSSIER_COVER','CASE_TIMELINE':'REQUEST_SUPPORTING','FIELD_ACTIVITY_LOG':'FIELD_ACTIVITY_LOG','LAB_RESULT_REVIEW':'LAB_RESULT_REVIEW','INSPECTION_MINUTES':'FIELD_INSPECTION_MINUTES','SAMPLE_HANDOVER':'SAMPLE_HANDOVER_LAB'};
const pcnStepRows=pcnMatrix.flatMap(m=>pcnPackStepTitles.map((step,i)=>{const configured=pcnPackStepFiles[i+1]||[],codes=configured.includes('*')?m.documents.map(d=>d.code):configured,docs=m.documents.filter(d=>codes.includes(d.code));return {case:m.fieldCode+' · '+m.catalogId,mapId:m.mapId,stepNumber:i+1,step:String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')+' · '+step[1]+' · '+step[0],ids:docs.map(d=>d.id),files:docs.map(d=>d.name),requirement:docs.map(d=>(d.required?'Required baseline code':'Optional / conditional')+' — '+d.condition).join(' | ')||(i===1?'Only select a matching PUBLISHED workflow; live DB NOT_VERIFIED.':i===3?'Snapshot stores matched revision/node/transition; not a file.':i===5?'Node input files are data-driven by workflowSnapshot; live node requirements NOT_VERIFIED.':'No fixed file; use the proposal, dossier or snapshot record.'),owner:[...new Set(docs.map(d=>d.owner))].join(' · ')||'PCN intake API / assigned operator',state:PCN_ITEM_STATE,workflow:'Blank dossier pack CONFIGURED_IN_CODE; runtime workflow ID/version/status NOT_VERIFIED',docTemplates:[...new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>d.docTemplates.map(t=>t.id+' · '+t.file+' · '+t.status+' '+t.usage)))],source:[...new Set(docs.map(d=>d.source))]}}));
const pgdStepRows=pgdRequirementMatrix.flatMap(m=>pgdSteps.map((step,i)=>{const docs=m.documents.filter(d=>(pgdStepFiles[i+1]||[]).includes(d.id));const templates=[...new Set(docs.flatMap(d=>pgdManifest.templates.filter(t=>PGD_TEMPLATE_KIND[t.kind]===d.id).map(t=>t.code+' '+t.id+' · '+t.fileName)))];return {case:m.catalogCode+' · '+m.catalogId,mapId:m.mapId,stepNumber:i+1,step:String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')+' · '+step[0],ids:docs.map(d=>d.id),files:docs.map(d=>d.name),requirement:docs.map(d=>d.required+' — '+d.activation).join(' | ')||(i===5?'Sampling chỉ khi scope/method yêu cầu; bỏ qua cần policy đã publish và server gate.':i===6?'Bàn giao mẫu/PTN khi sampling và lab request áp dụng; runtime gate cần kiểm tra.':'Không có file mặc định; theo PYC/profile và backend stage/gate.'),owner:[...new Set(docs.map(d=>d.owner))].join(' · ')||'Chuyên viên PGD / reviewer',state:PGD_ITEM_STATE,workflow:'Workflow ID/version/status NOT_VERIFIED; DOCX manifest '+pgdManifest.version+' chỉ là danh mục biểu mẫu',docTemplates:templates,source:[...new Set(docs.map(d=>d.source))]}}));
write('node-playbook.json',JSON.stringify({revision:REV,uiRefreshRevision:UI_REV,maps,entries},null,2)+'\n');
write('document-matrix.json',JSON.stringify({revision:REV,uiRefreshRevision:UI_REV,uiNotes:{pcn:'Dossier detail tóm tắt tối đa ba file thiếu tại bước đang chọn; checklist đầy đủ mở bằng Xem danh sách tài liệu. Requirement vẫn từ snapshot/template.',pgd:'CTA điều hướng khi blocker/read-only/loading/error; action theo từng dòng; requiredness vẫn theo productGroup/profile/template và server gate.'},pcn:pcnMatrix,pgd:pgdRequirementMatrix,pcnSteps:pcnStepRows,pgdSteps:pgdStepRows,pcnDocManifest:pcnManifest.templates.map(t=>({id:t.id,kind:t.generationKind,file:t.fileName,status:t.status,usage:t.usage||'NORMAL'})),pgdDocManifestVersion:pgdManifest.version,pgdDocManifest:pgdManifest.templates.map(t=>({id:t.id,code:t.code,kind:t.kind,file:t.fileName,requiredPlaceholderKeys:t.requiredPlaceholderKeys}))},null,2)+'\n');
const CSS=':root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#0b1220;--panel:#111c2e;--panel2:#17253b;--text:#edf4ff;--muted:#a7b6cc;--line:#2a3a54;--accent:#73d0c2;--gold:#f0bd69;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,Segoe UI,sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}a{color:var(--accent)}button,input,select{font:inherit;color:var(--text);background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:.65rem}.wrap{max-width:1480px;margin:auto;padding:22px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem}.tag{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:.12rem .5rem}.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px}.grid{display:grid;gap:14px}.toolbar,.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}.toolbar input{flex:1;min-width:min(240px,100%)}.toolbar select{max-width:100%}.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(240px,390px) 1fr;gap:16px}.list{max-height:70vh;overflow:auto;display:grid;align-content:start;gap:7px}.list button{text-align:left}.list button[aria-current=true]{border-color:var(--accent)}.field{margin:.8rem 0}.field b{display:block;color:var(--accent)}.mapframe{width:100%;height:60vh;border:1px solid var(--line);background:white;border-radius:12px}.table-wrap{overflow:auto}.matrix{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:900px}.matrix td,.matrix th{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.matrix th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--panel2)}.hidden{display:none!important}@media(max-width:800px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.list{max-height:34vh}.wrap{padding:13px}.mapframe{height:50vh}}@media(prefers-color-scheme:light){:root{color-scheme:light;--bg:#f2f6fb;--panel:#fff;--panel2:#e8eef6;--text:#17263b;--muted:#53647b;--line:#cbd5e1;--accent:#087d77;--gold:#875706}}';
const shell=(title,body,script)=>'<!doctype html><html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><link rel="icon" href="data:,"><title>'+title+'</title><style>'+CSS+'</style></head><body>'+body+'<script>'+script+'</script></body></html>';
const handbook=shell('Sổ tay node PGDCN','<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PGDCN · Sổ tay vận hành</div><h1>Sổ tay node & yêu cầu hồ sơ</h1><p class="muted">Chọn node hoặc dùng fragment #node=&lt;id&gt;. Panel đồng bộ với bản đồ gốc; nút mở sơ đồ giữ nguyên Node Finder/Focus native Archify.</p><div class="toolbar"><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Tìm node, workflow ID, vai trò, file yêu cầu…"><select id="map"><option value="">Tất cả sơ đồ</option></select><select id="domain"><option value="">Tất cả domain</option><option>PCN</option><option>PGD</option><option>Hệ thống</option><option>Dùng chung</option></select><button id="clear">Xóa lọc</button></div><div class="two"><nav id="list" class="list" aria-label="Node list"></nav><section id="detail" class="card" aria-live="polite">Chọn node để xem yêu cầu.</section></div><h2>Bản đồ đã chọn</h2><iframe id="frame" class="mapframe" title="Bản đồ Archify" loading="lazy"></iframe><p><a href="index.html">← Atlas</a> · <a href="document-matrix-pcn.html">File PCN</a> · <a href="document-matrix-pgd.html">File PGD</a></p></main>',
 'const d='+q(entries)+';const M=new Map('+q(maps)+'.map(x=>[x.id,x]));const $=x=>document.querySelector(x),qel=$("#q"),mf=$("#map"),df=$("#domain"),list=$("#list"),detail=$("#detail"),frame=$("#frame");for(const m of M.values()){let o=document.createElement("option");o.value=m.id;o.textContent=m.title;mf.append(o)}function esc(x){return String(x??"").replace(/[&<>"]/g,c=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;","\\"":"&quot;"}[c]))}function val(k,v){return "<div class=field><b>"+esc(k)+"</b>"+esc(v)+"</div>"}function arr(k,a){return "<div class=field><b>"+esc(k)+"</b><ul>"+a.map(x=>"<li>"+esc(typeof x==="string"?x:JSON.stringify(x))+"</li>").join("")+"</ul></div>"}function show(e){detail.innerHTML="<div class=eyebrow>"+esc(e.domain)+" · "+esc(e.stage)+"</div><h2>"+esc(e.name)+"</h2><p>Node ID: <code>"+esc(e.diagramNodeId)+"</code> · "+esc(e.mapTitle)+"</p><p><span class=tag>Implementation: "+esc(e.implementationStatus)+"</span> <span class=tag>Workflow: "+esc(e.workflowTemplateId)+" · "+esc(e.workflowTemplateVersion)+" · "+esc(e.workflowTemplateStatus)+"</span></p><p><a target=_blank rel=noopener href=\\"diagram-viewer.html?map=\\"+encodeURIComponent(e.mapFile)+\\">Mở sơ đồ gốc (Node Finder / Focus)</a></p>"+arr("Cần làm theo thứ tự",e.actions)+val("Điều hướng / URL",e.navigation)+val("Người thực hiện",e.actor)+val("Người soát xét / ký",e.verifier)+val("Handoff tiếp theo",e.nextHandoff)+val("RBAC",e.rbac)+val("Chỉ đọc",e.readOnly)+arr("Điều kiện đầu vào",e.preconditions)+arr("File đầu vào",e.filesIn.map(x=>x.id+" · "+x.label+" · "+x.requirement+" · khi: "+x.activation+" · owner: "+x.supplier+" · trạng thái: "+x.acceptableStatus))+arr("File đầu ra",e.filesOut.map(x=>x.id+" · "+x.label+" · "+x.action))+val("Guard server / hoàn tất",e.guard)+val("Nhánh / điều kiện",e.branch)+arr("Lỗi / chờ / trả lại",e.failures)+val("Trạng thái sau bước",e.afterState)+arr("Nguồn code",e.evidence.map(x=>x.path+":"+x.line+"-"+x.end_line));frame.src=e.mapFile}function draw(){let t=qel.value.trim().toLowerCase(),rows=d.filter(e=>(!mf.value||e.mapId===mf.value)&&(!df.value||e.domain===df.value)&&(!t||JSON.stringify(e).toLowerCase().includes(t)));list.replaceChildren();for(const e of rows){let b=document.createElement("button");b.textContent=e.mapTitle+" · "+e.name;b.onclick=()=>{location.hash="node="+encodeURIComponent(e.id);show(e);draw()};b.setAttribute("aria-current",location.hash.includes(encodeURIComponent(e.id))?"true":"false");list.append(b)}let id=decodeURIComponent((location.hash.match(/#node=([^&]+)/)||[])[1]||"");let active=d.find(e=>e.id===id)||rows[0];if(active)show(active);else detail.textContent="Không có node khớp."}qel.oninput=draw;mf.onchange=draw;df.onchange=draw;$("#clear").onclick=()=>{qel.value="";mf.value="";df.value="";draw()};onhashchange=draw;draw();');
write('node-handbook.html',handbook);

function matrixPage(isPcn){
 const title=isPcn?'Bảng hồ sơ/file theo bước PCN':'Bảng hồ sơ/file theo bước PGD';
 const rows=isPcn?pcnStepRows:pgdStepRows;
 const uiNote=isPcn?'Dossier detail tóm tắt tối đa ba file thiếu tại bước đang chọn; “Xem danh sách tài liệu” mở checklist đầy đủ. Requirement vẫn theo snapshot/template.':'Khi bị chặn hoặc chỉ xem/đang tải/lỗi, CTA chỉ mở workbench; action theo dòng dùng đúng role, trạng thái chỉ đổi qua API gate. Requiredness vẫn phụ thuộc productGroup/profile/template.';
 const note=isPcn
  ?'PCN dùng 9 bước của map biến thể. MISSING / PRESENT / WAIVED là trạng thái checklist; PRESENT cần currentVersionId đã attach. File sinh còn draft tới confirm-to-dossier; upload chưa attach không đạt; review/verify là gate riêng; phiên trước được giữ nhưng đã superseded. Không đọc dữ liệu case.'
  :'PGD có đủ 12 bước cho từng profile. MISSING khi chưa có file asset liên kết; PRESENT khi đã attach; WAIVED chỉ khi có record và chưa xác minh đường mutation. Checklist PGD không có trạng thái riêng DRAFT / GENERATED / CONFIRMED; upload rời chưa đạt package/hash gate. Không đọc dữ liệu case.';
 const body='<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">PGDCN · Checklist / DOCX / hồ sơ theo bước</div><h1>'+title+'</h1><p class="muted">Danh mục hồ sơ và DOCX manifest là hai catalog khác nhau. Required/optional phản ánh baseline code; runtime override và workflow PUBLISHED chưa xác minh. '+note+'</p><p class="muted"><b>Điều hướng UI:</b> '+uiNote+' (đối chiếu source commit '+UI_REV+').</p><div class="toolbar"><input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Tìm mã, tên, file, actor, bước…"><select id="case"><option value="">Tất cả bộ hồ sơ</option></select><span id="count"></span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="matrix"><thead><tr><th>Bộ hồ sơ</th><th>Bước / handoff</th><th>ID / tên file</th><th>Required / activation / branch</th><th>Trạng thái theo model</th><th>Actor / supplier</th><th>Workflow / version</th><th>DOCX template / source</th></tr></thead><tbody id="rows"></tbody></table></div><p><a href="index.html">← Atlas</a> · <a href="node-handbook.html">Sổ tay node</a> · <a href="'+(isPcn?'03-pcn-canonical.html':'04-pgd-canonical.html')+'">Sơ đồ '+(isPcn?'PCN':'PGD')+'</a></p></main>';
 const script='const d='+q(rows)+';const $=x=>document.querySelector(x),q=$("#q"),s=$("#case"),b=$("#rows"),c=$("#count");for(const x of [...new Set(d.map(r=>r.case))]){const o=document.createElement("option");o.value=x;o.textContent=x;s.append(o)}function esc(x){return String(x??"").replace(/[&<>"]/g,v=>({"&":"&amp;","<":"&lt;",">":"&gt;","\\"":"&quot;"}[v]))}function draw(){let t=q.value.trim().toLowerCase(),a=d.filter(x=>(!s.value||x.case===s.value)&&(!t||JSON.stringify(x).toLowerCase().includes(t)));c.textContent=a.length+" dòng";b.innerHTML=a.map(x=>"<tr><td>"+esc(x.case)+"</td><td>"+esc(x.step)+"</td><td><code>"+esc(x.ids.join(" · ")||"N/A")+"</code><br>"+esc(x.files.join(" · ")||"Không áp dụng")+"</td><td>"+esc(x.requirement)+"</td><td>"+esc(x.state)+"</td><td>"+esc(x.owner)+"</td><td>"+esc(x.workflow)+"</td><td>"+esc(x.docTemplates.join(" | ")||"Không có mapping DOCX cố định")+"<br>"+esc(x.source.join(" | "))+"</td></tr>").join("")}q.oninput=draw;s.onchange=draw;draw()';
 return shell(title,body,script);
}
write('document-matrix-pcn.html',matrixPage(true));
write('document-matrix-pgd.html',matrixPage(false));

const technical=[['00-master','S? ?? t?ng quan tham chi?u'],['01-navigation','?i?u h??ng'],['02-pcn-intake-assignment','PCN intake / assignment'],['03-pcn-dynamic-workflow','PCN workflow contract'],['04-pgd-12-steps','PGD 12 steps (reference)'],['05-documents-and-templates','Documents and templates'],['06-samples-and-lab','Samples and lab'],['07-pgd-evidence-approval-package','PGD evidence / approval / package'],['08-auth-rbac','Authentication and RBAC'],['09-ai-ocr','AI and OCR'],['10-system-architecture','System architecture'],['11-data-lineage','Data lineage'],['12-data-model-erd','Data model ERD'],['13-audit-notifications','Audit and notifications'],['14-customers-and-work-queues','Customers and work queues'],['15-deployment-security','Deployment security'],['16-sequence-pcn-create','PCN create sequence'],['17-sequence-document-upload-attach','Document upload sequence'],['18-sequence-pgd-pyc-kqtn','PGD PYC / KQTN sequence'],['19-sequence-pcn-approval-release','PCN approval / release sequence']].map(x=>({id:'tech-'+x[0],title:x[1],file:x[0]+'.html',candidate:x[0]+'.candidate.json',domain:'Tham chiếu',group:'technical',primary:false,status:'IMPLEMENTED',workflowId:'REFERENCE',workflowVersion:'N/A',workflowStatus:'REFERENCE',templateId:'N/A',templateVersion:'N/A',templateStatus:'N/A',searchText:x[1]}));
